        "Since the \"my reservations\" list is found using just the restaurant and the guest's email — and neither of those is private — could someone see another guest's bookings just by knowing their email address?"
      ],
      "pages": [
        "<div style=\"padding:40px;background:#f5f7fa;min-height:100%;font-size:16px\"><h1 class=\"title is-2\">My Reservations</h1><p class=\"subtitle is-5\">Look up every table you currently have booked.</p><div class=\"box\" style=\"padding:24px;margin-bottom:28px;max-width:640px\"><div class=\"field has-addons\"><div class=\"control is-expanded\"><input class=\"input is-medium\" type=\"email\" value=\"guest@example.com\" /></div><div class=\"control\"><button class=\"button is-primary is-medium\">Find</button></div></div></div><div class=\"box\" style=\"padding:0\"><table class=\"table is-fullwidth is-striped\" style=\"font-size:16px\"><thead><tr><th>Code</th><th>Start</th><th>End</th><th>Number of People</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"tag is-info is-medium\">R7K2QX</span></td><td>2026-09-18 19:00</td><td>2026-09-18 21:00</td><td>4</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"tag is-info is-medium\">M3P8ZW</span></td><td>2026-10-02 18:30</td><td>2026-10-02 20:30</td><td>2</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"help\" style=\"margin-top:16px\">Active reservations only. Cancelled bookings are not listed.</p></div>"
